        "source:communitydragon:16.16:zh_cn:Ambessa"
      ],
      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Ambessa sweeps her twin drakehounds in a semicircle in front of her, dealing bonus damage to enemies hit by the blades. Striking an enemy will transform the next cast of this ability for a short period of time, causing her to slam her twin drakehounds down in a line in front of her, dealing bonus damage to the first enemy hit.",
      "summary_zh": "安蓓萨甩出链刃横扫她前方的半圆区域，对被链刃命中的敌人造成额外伤害。击中一个敌人后，该技能在短时间内的下一次施放会发生变化，使她向前方的一条直线猛砸链刃，对命中的首个敌人造成额外伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": []
    },
