      "summary_en": "Ambessa gains a shield, briefly braces herself, and then slams the ground to damage nearby enemies. If she blocked any non-minion damage while bracing herself, this ability will deal increased damage.",
      "summary_zh": "安蓓萨获得一道护盾，在短时间内摆出防守姿势，随后猛砸地面，对附近敌人造成伤害。如果她在防守姿势期间格挡了任何来自非小兵单位的伤害，该技能将造成额外伤害。",
